Ohle Claussen <claussen@dpi.physik.uni-goettingen.de> writes:

> On 2006-06-22, Jack Bolsen wrote:
> > I did, once, hear a tale of someone who actually managed to cancel death 
> > and then tame him for a pet - but I have not actually done this myself 
> > so I cannot vouch for it.
> 
> I doubt that. IMO, Death, being level drain resistant, is the only rider 
> that cannot be tamed.

You can't tame Death while he's in his natural form, but if you can
polymorph him you can tame the resulting monster.  In vanilla Nethack,
polymorph is permanent so this is not particularly useful.  In
Slash'EM, however, you can use this idea to acquire a pet Death.  See
http://www.statslab.cam.ac.uk/~eva/nethack/iaq.html if you want the
full details.
